      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this charming 2-bedroom end-of-terrace duplex to the market, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Hunters Wood development in Ballycullen, Dublin 24.\nNo. 61 Hunters Green is presented in excellent condition throughout and boasts c.77 sq.m of well-appointed accommodation split over two levels. Upon entering, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming hallway which leads into a spacious dual-aspect lounge/kitchen/dining area, flooded with natural light and featuring direct access to a private ground-floor patio. A generous downstairs WC completes the ground floor. Upstairs, there are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite, alongside a stylish and well-appointed family bathroom.\nHunters Wood enjoys an enviable setting at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, with an excellent selection of amenities close by. Tesco Superstore, Lidl and a crèche are all within easy reach, while a host of schools, shops, restaurants, sporting facilities and recreational amenities can also be found nearby.\nThe development is well served by regular public transport links, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while the M50 motorway is just a short drive away, offering excellent connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond.\nCombining bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a superb location, No. 61 Hunters Green is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors and those looking to trade up alike. Early viewing is highly recommended.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n- c. 77 sq m\n- 2 bed, 3 bath\n- End of Terrace duplex\n- C energy rating\n- Built c.2004\n- Electric heating\n- Double glazed windows\n- Private ground floor patio\n- Designated car port\n- Well presented throughout\n- Two generous double bedrooms\n- Highly sought after development\n- Early viewing highly advised!\n\nBER Details\nBER: C\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 H1XR"
      },
      {
